OL,3,GNEWSAStaff sickness a major factor
OL,4,Abehind critical incident, says NHS
OL,5,AGrampian boss
OL,6,
OL,7,FStaff sickness was a major factor
OL,8,Fbehind the critical incident declared
OL,9,Fby NHS Grampian last month, its chief
OL,10,Fexecutive has said.
OL,12,FA board-level critical incident had
OL,13,Fbeen declared on Saturday 26 September,
OL,14,Fwhen A&Es at both Aberdeen Royal
OL,15,FInfirmary (ARI) and Dr Gray's in Elgin
OL,16,Fstruggled to cope with demand.
OL,18,FThat was stood down on the Monday, and
OL,19,Fremained in place at hospital level at
OL,20,FDr Gray's until the next day.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
