OL,3,GNEWSAStaff sickness a major factor
OL,4,Abehind critical incident, says NHS
OL,5,AGrampian boss
OL,6,
OL,7,FNHS Grampian chief executive Laura
OL,8,FSkaife-Knight told BBC Scotland News
OL,9,Fthat staff sickness had been a
OL,10,F"challenge", and ensuring patient
OL,11,Fsafety was the reason for declaring the
OL,12,Fcritical incident.
